                  <items count="4">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Export probed facade pressure coefficients into the EnergyPlus AirflowNetwork as an .idf snippet: WindPressureCoefficientArray (the simulated directions), per-node WindPressureCoefficientValues and ExternalNode objects, ready to paste/merge into a Ladybug Tools (or hand-built) AirflowNetwork model. Enable Pressure Coefficient in Run Settings, probe the Cp field at facade points, and wire the probe tree here.

Version 1.9.0.827

Version 1.9.0.827</item>
